{"3620860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kung Fu Addiction", "steam_appid": 3620860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luck creates the situation, but skill determines the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're an &quot;unlucky&quot; person, this game... IS NOT FOR YOU. But if you enjoy defying the odds and making the most of whatever fate throws at you, you're going to have a great time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/cf4dbe01682fdf69b05cc1ec3d0b6f9a.poster.avif?t=1788179526\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/cf4dbe01682fdf69b05cc1ec3d0b6f9a.webm?t=1788179526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/cf4dbe01682fdf69b05cc1ec3d0b6f9a.mp4?t=1788179526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core of the game is built around chance. Every battle presents a random sequence of actions, but what you do with that sequence is what truly matters. Every decision counts from how you develop your fighter's stats and abilities to the perks you unlock and the strategies you choose. Your predictions and decisions determine whether you overcome your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/f6b104962a2568af30e7de12b43bffaf.poster.avif?t=1788179526\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/f6b104962a2568af30e7de12b43bffaf.webm?t=1788179526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/f6b104962a2568af30e7de12b43bffaf.mp4?t=1788179526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHAPE YOUR HERO’S SKILLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your fighter and customize their physical appearance, then define their combat style through a flexible skill tree. Choose a high-damage, defensive, or balanced approach and build a warrior that fits your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/6d3de360e99c6a9d755639c10adde67d.poster.avif?t=1788179526\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/6d3de360e99c6a9d755639c10adde67d.webm?t=1788179526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/6d3de360e99c6a9d755639c10adde67d.mp4?t=1788179526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE MULTIPLE THREATS ACROSS DIFFERENT COMBAT MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two battles feel the same. Different enemies, combat modes, and rule variations constantly challenge you to adapt your strategy, rethink your build, and anticipate new attack patterns as the difficulty escalates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/fe2fc01aec06296cb7c2add9ae42897f.poster.avif?t=1788179526\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/fe2fc01aec06296cb7c2add9ae42897f.webm?t=1788179526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/fe2fc01aec06296cb7c2add9ae42897f.mp4?t=1788179526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER MULTIPLE MARTIAL ARTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock secret techniques that let you channel the souls of ancient warriors. When you're defeated, you'll resurrect with a different martial art, giving you a second chance to adapt, overcome, and continue the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/bdf4922c2fe0fcfe29c0303f00afc76a.poster.avif?t=1788179526\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/bdf4922c2fe0fcfe29c0303f00afc76a.webm?t=1788179526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/bdf4922c2fe0fcfe29c0303f00afc76a.mp4?t=1788179526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic auto-battler combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible skill tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple combat modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master different martial arts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escalating difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-based decision making</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luck creates the situation, but skill determines the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're an &quot;unlucky&quot; person, this game... IS NOT FOR YOU. But if you enjoy defying the odds and making the most of whatever fate throws at you, you're going to have a great time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/cf4dbe01682fdf69b05cc1ec3d0b6f9a.poster.avif?t=1788179526\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/cf4dbe01682fdf69b05cc1ec3d0b6f9a.webm?t=1788179526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/cf4dbe01682fdf69b05cc1ec3d0b6f9a.mp4?t=1788179526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core of the game is built around chance. Every battle presents a random sequence of actions, but what you do with that sequence is what truly matters. Every decision counts from how you develop your fighter's stats and abilities to the perks you unlock and the strategies you choose. Your predictions and decisions determine whether you overcome your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/f6b104962a2568af30e7de12b43bffaf.poster.avif?t=1788179526\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/f6b104962a2568af30e7de12b43bffaf.webm?t=1788179526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/f6b104962a2568af30e7de12b43bffaf.mp4?t=1788179526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHAPE YOUR HERO’S SKILLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your fighter and customize their physical appearance, then define their combat style through a flexible skill tree. Choose a high-damage, defensive, or balanced approach and build a warrior that fits your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/6d3de360e99c6a9d755639c10adde67d.poster.avif?t=1788179526\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/6d3de360e99c6a9d755639c10adde67d.webm?t=1788179526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/6d3de360e99c6a9d755639c10adde67d.mp4?t=1788179526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE MULTIPLE THREATS ACROSS DIFFERENT COMBAT MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two battles feel the same. Different enemies, combat modes, and rule variations constantly challenge you to adapt your strategy, rethink your build, and anticipate new attack patterns as the difficulty escalates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/fe2fc01aec06296cb7c2add9ae42897f.poster.avif?t=1788179526\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/fe2fc01aec06296cb7c2add9ae42897f.webm?t=1788179526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620860/extras/fe2fc01aec06296cb7c2add9ae42897f.mp4?t=1788179526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER MULTIPLE MARTIAL ARTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock secret 